iption\n- Add the general POVM projection inequality, conjugate-isometry transfer estimates and unit-ancilla embedding/intertwining results, with five explicitly auxiliary blueprint entries.\n- Preserve the original proof-module blobs and historical audit evidence. Reconcile the gap note with the source-facing extraction-witness composition already on main, distinguishing these generic transfer results from the remaining concrete isometry and final soundness obligations.\n- Keep the source-facing `pauli_soundness` statement and its existing proof gap. Reuse the scalar square-root error bound already on main.\n\n### Testing\n- Published head `88d73454b1b276a5be615d646dbd906640d60603`: all nine local CI statuses passed in 422 seconds. Build, blueprint render, paper-gap, synchronization and proof-integrity gates ran; statement-origin was skipped by the path filter.\n- The rooted axiom audit passed 1,669 declarations with zero failures and three existing statement-level warnings. No proof-level leanok declaration depends on sorryAx.\n- The author packet passed focused Lean checks and targeted module builds, ten public and two private standard-only axiom probes, blueprint rendering and synchronization, and relevant gap/audit checks. The gap-note refresh also passed normal hooks with 699 workflow tests and 9 skipped.\n- MAIN passed the refreshed Soundness build (8,771 jobs), verified the clean conflict-free refresh and unchanged four proof/audit blobs, and confirmed the complete 50,985-byte normalized contribution is identical before and after refresh. The duplicate check found none of the ten public declarations already on main.\n\n---\nAddresses #529\n", "created_at": "2026-09-18T05:54:14Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T06:07:42Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "2deb42658f0633e2c14238efab719f416cab76d9", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025010884, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8axA", "url"